   "text": "Does: turns free-text claim emails into structured lines and runs each\nthrough the checker; email text never changes a verdict\nIn: claim_emails.csv (30 emails)\nOut: claim lines + verdicts; INR 1.44 cr of credited claims that need a\nperson\nTools: none (pure Python)\nUpstream: mailbox rule (stockist code)\nDownstream: Claim Gatekeeper, then claims desk",
   "originalText": "Does: turns free-text claim emails into structured lines and runs each\nthrough the checker; email text never changes a verdict\nIn: claim_emails.csv (30 emails)\nOut: claim lines + verdicts; INR 1.44 cr of credited claims that need a\nperson\nTools: none (pure Python)\nUpstream: mailbox rule (stockist code)\nDownstream: Claim Gatekeeper, then claims desk",
