   "text": "Does: guides a claim filing: classify intent, collect fields, validate,\ncheck data, risk score, store\nIn: chat message (create, status, recovery)\nOut: claim_no + summary; reply wording by model, figures guarded\nTools: claim checker, SQLite; model only for intent fallback and\nwording\nUpstream: stockist or C&F user\nDownstream: Claim Gatekeeper rules, SQLite, Review Queue (human)",
   "originalText": "Does: guides a claim filing: classify intent, collect fields, validate,\ncheck data, risk score, store\nIn: chat message (create, status, recovery)\nOut: claim_no + summary; reply wording by model, figures guarded\nTools: claim checker, SQLite; model only for intent fallback and\nwording\nUpstream: stockist or C&F user\nDownstream: Claim Gatekeeper rules, SQLite, Review Queue (human)",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
