   "text": "Does: replays all 4,503 claims in date order and buckets credited and\npending money\nIn: cleaned claims and invoices\nOut: T1, T2, hold, review, unverifiable buckets; by stockist; stored in\nSQLite\nTools: claim checker\nUpstream: Claim Gatekeeper rules\nDownstream: Opportunity Register, Recovery page, Recovery List",
