   "text": "Does: answers a leader's question with a sourced figure: input guard,\nmodel picks a tool, tool guard, tools, output guard (max 12 trips)\nIn: question text (800 chars max)\nOut: answer + evidence + flags + usage; ungrounded figures flagged\nTools: 11 read-only tools: lookup_batch, validate_claim,\nget_recovery_summary, get_stock_cover, get_dispatch_quality,\nget_scheme_cap, get_fill_rate, ...\nUpstream: user, guardrails\nDownstream: analysis and claim engines; OpenRouter gpt-4o-mini",
   "originalText": "Does: answers a leader's question with a sourced figure: input guard,\nmodel picks a tool, tool guard, tools, output guard (max 12 trips)\nIn: question text (800 chars max)\nOut: answer + evidence + flags + usage; ungrounded figures flagged\nTools: 11 read-only tools: lookup_batch, validate_claim,\nget_recovery_summary, get_stock_cover, get_dispatch_quality,\nget_scheme_cap, get_fill_rate, ...\nUpstream: user, guardrails\nDownstream: analysis and claim engines; OpenRouter gpt-4o-mini",
