   "text": "Does: tests free goods against the 3% cap, scheme claim rates, and a\nproposed scheme order against 2.5 months of stock\nIn: quarter, SKU, proposed order\nOut: cap status, claim rate, BLOCK SCHEME or not (proxy; RSM confirms)\nTools: none\nUpstream: clean data layer\nDownstream: Scheme Returns page; Ask tools; Opportunity Register; RSM\nand NSM",
