   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Reconciliation of disagreements: there is no agent-to-agent negotiation. Every rule is written once (claim_checks.py, enforced by tests/test_rules.py), so agents cannot disagree on a verdict.\nNo cross-agent LLM handoff exists. Cheapest-first routing: Intake Assistant tries keywords before it calls the model. Ask Analyst is capped at 12 tool trips.",
   "originalText": "Reconciliation of disagreements: there is no agent-to-agent negotiation. Every rule is written once (claim_checks.py, enforced by tests/test_rules.py), so agents cannot disagree on a verdict.\nNo cross-agent LLM handoff exists. Cheapest-first routing: Intake Assistant tries keywords before it calls the model. Ask Analyst is capped at 12 tool trips.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
